              "Okudukum",
              "Okuyan"
            ]
          ],
          "translation": "The book I’m reading is really good.",
          "explanation": "oku + duk + um, and k before a vowel → ğ."
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "___ yazar kim? (you love)",
          "answers": [
            [
              "Sevdiğin"
            ]
